Package: com.idroidik.setup
Name: iDroidik Setup
Version: 1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: On-device setup for iDroidik (Android 16 on iPhone 7). Creates the Android APFS volume, downloads the Android image, generates firmware from your own iOS, and provisions persistent storage. Requires iPhone 7 on iOS 15.
Maintainer: iDroidik
Author: iDroidik
Section: Utilities
Depends: firmware (>= 0.1)
Priority: optional
